<li data-section-id=3D"1nryksa" data-start=3D"642" data-end=3D"688">
<p data-start=3D"644" data-end=3D"688">Are no longer required by anything i=
nstalled</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"690" data-end=3D"707">So this tells us:</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"709" data-end=3D"814">
<p data-start=3D"711" data-end=3D"814">Your system is not full of orphaned =
packages. Most installed software is still referenced by something.</p>
</blockquote>
