<p data-start=3D"821" data-end=3D"911">=E2=80=9Cdpkg knows the package is i=
nstalled, but its file list metadata is missing or corrupted.=E2=80=9D</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"913" data-end=3D"941">This typically happens when:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"942" data-end=3D"1143">
<li data-section-id=3D"1g5cl0y" data-start=3D"942" data-end=3D"975">
