<p data-start=3D"77" data-end=3D"135"><strong data-start=3D"77" data-end=3D=
"135">Recovery voltage must be LOWER than protection voltage</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"137" data-end=3D"215">But your question is slightly deeper=
