<li data-section-id=3D"ltk3ud" data-start=3D"1478" data-end=3D"1518">
<p data-start=3D"1480" data-end=3D"1518">LiFePO=E2=82=84: ~2.8=E2=80=933.0V=
 (depends on system)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"ugtcym" data-start=3D"1520" data-end=3D"1541">Recove=
ry spacing:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1542" data-end=3D"1581">
<li data-section-id=3D"1dlq6tt" data-start=3D"1542" data-end=3D"1581">
<p data-start=3D"1544" data-end=3D"1581"><strong data-start=3D"1544" data-e=
nd=3D"1581">0.1V to 0.3V per cell is standard</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1583" data-end=3D"1586">
<h2 data-section-id=3D"1y2f8p5" data-start=3D"1588" data-end=3D"1627">=E2=
=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F Practical advice for solar setups</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1628" data-end=3D"1660">Since you said =E2=80=9Csolar sett=
ings=E2=80=9D:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1662" data-end=3D"1787">
<li data-section-id=3D"1srset4" data-start=3D"1662" data-end=3D"1718">
<p data-start=3D"1664" data-end=3D"1718">Too tight gap =E2=86=92 oscillatio=
n (charge/discharge chatter)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"oznlke" data-start=3D"1719" data-end=3D"1787">
<p data-start=3D"1721" data-end=3D"1787">Too wide gap =E2=86=92 delayed rec=
overy (battery stays =E2=80=9Coffline=E2=80=9D too long)</p>
